WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.140
One story, told for every screen.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.650
This test checks that a single
storyboard adapts to each format.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:11.610
When the frame is wide,
image and text sit side by side.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:16.200
When it is tall, they stack, and the text
stays clear of the platform's buttons.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:20.920
A widescreen frame is
nineteen twenty pixels across.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.550
The chart turns sideways to
suit the format it appears in.
